  "meta": {
    "description": "Entry point. Verifies the signed start, asks the backend to begin the run (which selects the workflow definition and returns its stage descriptors), then executes each stage generically: kind decides the call pattern, `when` is evaluated against the flags seen so far, and the stage's own retry/timeout values are applied. It names no specialty, no stage and no clinical branch, and holds no case content, key or database login.",
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": true
